    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a \"cloak\" or something i can just take off. it feels like i'm the problem. i look at my kid and i just think... if they didn't have to worry about me, or my mess, or my sadness... they could actually breathe. it feels like the only way to stop hurting them is to stop being a part of their life. it feels like the only selfless thing left to do is to just... go.",
